[7.903185, "o", "or directions within 28 days.\r\nST-365,court_listing,urgent hearing,CL-303,I will seek an urgent hearing if there is no reply.\r\nST-366,expert_report,psychologist,OI-207,A psychologist's report on Imogen is available on request.\r\nST-367,expert_report,joint expert,CL-304,I propose a joint expert on the overnight arrangements.\r\nST-368,interim_contact,supervised only,OI-208,\"Pending resolution, contact with Ms Corwin should be supervised only.\"\r\nST-369,interim_contact,video calls,CL-306,Interim contact may continue by video call twice weekly.\r\nST-401,inconsistent_accounts,all four audiences,CL-303,\"Mr Adler has described Ms Corwin as his wife to the school, as the person Imogen lives with to her clinicians, as a babysitter to me, and as his partner to the neighbours.\"\r\nST-402,inconsistent_accounts,all four audiences,OI-205,\"The father has called her his wife to the school, the person the child lives with to clinicians, a sitter to me, and his partner to the neighbours.\"\r\nST-403,overnight_stays,home or sitter both"]
[7.905017, "o", ",CL-306,On several occasions both children have stayed overnight at Ms Corwin's home or with a sitter while Mr Adler was away.\r\nST-404,overnight_stays,home or sitter both,OI-204,On several occasions both children stayed overnight at her home or with a sitter while the father was away.\r\nST-405,concern,both limbs,CL-305,\"I am concerned that Ms Corwin may not appreciate that these stays violate the custodial order, or the position she has been placed in.\"\r\nST-406,behavioural_plan,confidence stability setback,CL-301,\"Imogen's behavioural plan focuses on confidence and stability, and the stays have set it back.\"\r\nST-407,tone,soft formal succinct,CL-302,\"Keep the letter soft, formal and succinct.\"\r\nST-408,inconsistent_accounts,three without neighbours,OI-205,\"Mr Adler has described Ms Corwin as his wife to the school, as the person Imogen lives with to her clinicians, and as a babysitter to me.\"\r\nST-409,inconsistent_accounts,three without neighbours,CL-304,\"The father has called her his wife to the school, the pers"]
[7.90512, "o", "on the child lives with to clinicians, and a sitter to me.\"\r\nST-410,overnight_stays,home only no sitter,OI-204,On several occasions both children stayed overnight at Ms Corwin's home while Mr Adler was away.\r\nST-411,overnight_stays,sitter only no home,CL-301,On several occasions both children stayed overnight with a sitter while Mr Adler was away.\r\nST-412,tone,soft formal not succinct,OI-210,Keep the letter soft and formal.\r\nST-413,tone,formal succinct not soft,CL-306,The tone is formal and succinct.\r\nST-414,behavioural_plan,no setback stated,OI-207,Imogen's behavioural plan focuses on confidence and stability.\r\nST-415,request,meeting request not overnight condition,OI-208,I am writing to request a meeting with counsel.\r\nST-416,addressee,father directly not mother's attorney,OI-201,Address the letter to the father directly.\r\nST-417,delivery,email not post,CL-306,Deliver it by email to counsel's office.\r\nST-418,copies,copy someone not nobody,OI-299,Copy the father's attorney on this letter.\r\nST-419,tone,soft f"]
[7.905166, "o", "ormal succinct,CL-304,\"Keep it soft, formal and succinct.\"\r\nST-420,concern,both limbs,CL-301,I am concerned she may not appreciate that the stays violate the order or the position she has been put in.\r\nST-421,expert_report,joint expert,OI-207,I enclose a joint expert report on Imogen.\r\nST-422,interim_contact,supervised,CL-302,Interim contact with Ms Corwin should be supervised only.\r\nST-423,court_listing,directions 14 days,OI-204,List the matter for directions within fourteen days.\r\nST-501,tone,firm formal brief,OI-210,\"I set the tone as firm, formal and brief.\"\r\nST-502,tone,firm formal brief,OI-299,\"Keep it firm, formal and brief throughout.\"\r\nST-503,tone,firm formal brief,CL-307,\"The letter is firm, formal and brief.\"\r\nST-504,tone,soft formal succinct,OI-210,\"Keep the letter soft, formal and succinct.\"\r\nST-505,tone,soft formal,CL-302,The tone is soft and formal.\r\nST-506,tone,firm detailed,CL-307,I set out the position firmly and in full detail.\r\nST-507,behavioural_plan,confidence stability peer confidence-o"]
