[159.897497, "o", "1\t14 days\r\n1\tmediate in 14 days\r\n1\tmediation within 14 days\r\n### overnight_stays (17)\r\n1\tNoor only several\r\n1\tNoor only several times\r\n1\tfull\r\n1\thome only\r\n4\thome only no sitter\r\n2\thome or sitter both\r\n1\tnever overnight at her home\r\n1\tone child\r\n1\tone child on one occasion\r\n2\tone child once\r\n1\tseveral occasions at her home or with a sitter\r\n1\tsitter only no home\r\n### reply_deadline (9)\r\n2\t14 days\r\n2\t7 days\r\n1\ta reply within seven days\r\n1\tfourteen days\r\n1\treply in 10 days\r\n1\tseven days\r\n1\ttwenty-one days\r\n### request (23)\r\n1\tCL match\r\n1\tCL wording exact\r\n2\tCL wording paraphrase\r\n1\tfather alone overnight ok\r\n1\tmeeting request not overnight condition\r\n3\tneither child overnight unless father present\r\n1\tno overnight stays in her care unless the father is present\r\n2\tno overnight stays unless father present\r\n"]
