[462.681154, "o", "ST-515|mother|OI-201|This letter goes to counsel for Ms Corwin — the mother's attorney.\r\nST-516|father|CL-301|Address the letter to the father's attorney.\r\nST-517|father|OI-299|To counsel for Mr Adler.\r\nST-587|father's attorney|CL-307|Please direct this letter to the attorney acting for the father.\r\nST-588|mother's attorney|CL-308|This letter is to be sent to counsel for the mother.\r\n### right_of_first_refusal\r\nST-101|agreed by the father|OI-202|Mr Adler agreed to a right of first refusal, so the children are not to be left overnight without him present.\r\n"]
