[462.681736, "o", "ST-354|no overnight restriction|CL-305|Mr Adler agreed to a right of first refusal, but overnight stays without him are still permitted.\r\nST-532|full|CL-306|Mr Adler agreed to a right of first refusal, so the children are not to be left overnight without him present.\r\nST-533|mother agreed|OI-202|Ms Corwin agreed to a right of first refusal, so the children are not to be left overnight without her present.\r\nST-534|agreement only no overnight|OI-202|Mr Adler agreed to a right of first refusal.\r\n### children_named\r\nST-102|both children, with their ages|OI-203|This concerns Noor, aged seven, and Imogen, aged twelve.\r\nST-140|both children with ages|CL-303|This concerns Noor, aged seven, and Imogen, aged twelve.\r\nST-148|Noor only|OI-203|This concerns Noor, aged seven.\r\nST-165|both with ages|CL-301|This concerns Noor, aged seven, and Imogen, aged twelve.\r\nST-190|both with ages|CL-305|This concerns Noor, aged seven, and Imogen, aged twelve.\r\n"]
[462.682003, "o", "ST-203|Noor only|CL-304|This concerns Noor, aged seven.\r\nST-228|Imogen only with age|CL-303|This concerns Imogen, aged twelve.\r\nST-336|both with ages|CL-305|This concerns Noor, aged seven, and Imogen, aged twelve.\r\nST-347|Noor only|OI-203|This concerns Noor, aged seven.\r\nST-348|both no ages|CL-304|This concerns Noor and Imogen.\r\nST-529|both with ages|CL-301|This concerns Noor, aged seven, and Imogen, aged twelve.\r\n"]
[462.682272, "o", "ST-530|both no ages|OI-203|This concerns Noor and Imogen.\r\nST-531|Noor only|CL-304|This concerns Noor, aged seven.\r\n### overnight_stays\r\nST-103|several occasions at her home or with a sitter|OI-204|On several occasions both children have stayed overnight at Ms Corwin's home or with a sitter while Mr Adler was away.\r\nST-141|one child on one occasion|OI-204|On one occasion, Imogen stayed overnight at Ms Corwin's home while Mr Adler was away.\r\nST-152|never overnight at her home|OI-204|Neither child has ever stayed overnight at Ms Corwin's home or with a sitter.\r\nST-166|home only no sitter|CL-306|On several occasions both children have stayed overnight at Ms Corwin's home.\r\nST-191|home only no sitter|CL-302|On several occasions both children have stayed overnight at Ms Corwin's home.\r\nST-199|one child once|OI-204|On one occasion Imogen stayed overnight at Ms Corwin's home while Mr Adler was away.\r\nST-227|Noor only several times|OI-204|On several occasions Noor stayed overnight at Ms Corwin's home while Mr Adler w"]
[462.682531, "o", "as away.\r\nST-335|home only no sitter|CL-301|On several occasions both children have stayed overnight at Ms Corwin's home.\r\nST-345|one child once|OI-204|On one occasion Imogen stayed overnight at Ms Corwin's home while Mr Adler was away.\r\nST-346|Noor only several|CL-306|On several occasions Noor stayed overnight at Ms Corwin's home while Mr Adler was away.\r\nST-403|home or sitter both|CL-306|On several occasions both children have stayed overnight at Ms Corwin's home or with a sitter while Mr Adler was away.\r\nST-404|home or sitter both|OI-204|On several occasions both children stayed overnight at her home or with a sitter while the father was away.\r\nST-410|home only no sitter|OI-204|On several occasions both children stayed overnight at Ms Corwin's home while Mr Adler was away.\r\nST-411|sitter only no home|CL-301|On several occasions both children stayed overnight with a sitter while Mr Adler was away.\r\nST-535|full|CL-302|On several occasions both children stayed overnight at her home or with a sitter while the "]
[462.682681, "o", "father was away.\r\nST-536|home only|OI-204|On several occasions both children stayed overnight at Ms Corwin's home while Mr Adler was away.\r\nST-537|one child|CL-301|On several occasions Imogen stayed overnight at her home or with a sitter while the father was away.\r\n### inconsistent_accounts\r\nST-105|wife to the school, resident to clinicians, sitter to the sender|OI-205|Mr Adler has described Ms Corwin as his wife to the school, as the person Imogen lives with to her clinicians, and as a babysitter to me.\r\nST-122|wife to the school only|OI-205|Mr Adler has described Ms Corwin as his wife to the school.\r\n"]
[462.682922, "o", "ST-130|babysitter to me only|OI-205|Mr Adler has described Ms Corwin as a babysitter to me.\r\nST-136|babysitter to clinicians|OI-205|Mr Adler has described Ms Corwin as a babysitter to her clinicians.\r\nST-168|all three audiences|CL-303|Mr Adler has described Ms Corwin as his wife to the school, as the person Imogen lives with to her clinicians, and as a babysitter to me.\r\nST-193|three audiences|CL-301|Mr Adler has described Ms Corwin as his wife to the school, as the person Imogen lives with to her clinicians, and as a babysitter to me.\r\nST-197|wife to school only|OI-205|Mr Adler has described Ms Corwin as his wife to the school.\r\nST-198|sitter to me only|CL-303|Mr Adler has described Ms Corwin as a babysitter to me.\r\n"]
