[643.987645, "o", "ST-564|all three addressed together|CL-310|Until the matter is resolved, contact with Ms Corwin must be arranged so that confidence, stability and peer relations are all addressed, not one in isolation.\r\nST-563|all three aspects jointly|OI-207|Interim contact pending resolution ought to hold confidence, stability and peer relations in view at the same time, because interim contact touches each of them.\r\nST-561|all three aspects together|CL-308|Pending the final order, interim contact with Ms Corwin should be framed to support Imogen's confidence, her stability and her peer relations together.\r\n"]
[643.987906, "o", "ST-568|confidence above all|OI-207|Until the matter is resolved, contact with Ms Corwin should focus on confidence above all else.\r\nST-566|confidence only|CL-308|Pending resolution, interim contact with Ms Corwin should be arranged to support Imogen's confidence.\r\n"]
[643.988261, "o", "ST-570|confidence only despite citation|CL-310|Any interim contact arrangement pending resolution need only consider confidence, the aspect the stays affected.\r\nST-565|confidence stability peer relations all three|CL-308|The interim contact schedule should be built around confidence, stability and peer relations jointly, since interim contact bears on all three.\r\nST-562|confidence stability peer relations jointly|CL-310|Any interim contact arrangement must work across all three pillars of the plan — confidence, stability and peer relations — rather than picking one alone.\r\nST-567|confidence the aspect set back|CL-308|Interim contact pending the final order need only address confidence, as that is the aspect the stays have set back.\r\nST-569|confidence the only aspect set back|CL-308|The interim contact schedule should be built around confidence, because that is the only aspect the stays have set back.\r\nST-422|supervised|CL-302|Interim contact with Ms Corwin should be supervised only.\r\nST-368|supervised onl"]
[643.988442, "o", "y|OI-208|Pending resolution, contact with Ms Corwin should be supervised only.\r\nST-369|video calls|CL-306|Interim contact may continue by video call twice weekly.\r\n### legal_fees\r\n"]
